<title>USA: Spiegel's Eddie Bauer opens German store.</title>
<headline>Spiegel's Eddie Bauer opens German store.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eddie Bauer, a specialty retailer, said Thursday it opened its first store in Germany.</p>
<p>The store, located in Berlin, is part of its first European joint venture, Eddie Bauer Germany. Its partners in the venture are Heinrich Heine GmbH and Sport-Scheck GmbH, which are both part of the Otto Versand Group.</p>
<p>The joint venture operates a complete catalog division, offering Eddie Bauer sportswear throughout Germany.</p>
<p>Eddie Bauer is a unit of Spiegel Inc, based in Downers Grove, Ill.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
